The '''Olega Apothecary''' was an apothecary on the [[planet]] [[Olega]]. Inside the building, there was an array of natural herbs that covered every surface. The local shopkeeper would mix up various concoctions by request of his patrons.<ref name="Databank Olega apothecary">{{Databank|olega-apothecary|Olega Apothecary}}</ref> 

In [[132 BBY]],<ref name="Date">{{TheAcolyteDate}}</ref> [[The Stranger|Qimir]] used the shop as a base of operation during the [[Skirmish on Olega]]. When his apprentice [[Mae-ho Aniseya]] arrived, he informed her that he took a coat from the [[Catherio Para|man]] who owned the shop, so he could blend in with the local population. He then sent Aniseya to the nearby [[Olega Jedi temple]] to murder [[Jedi Master]] [[Torbin]]. After Aniseya failed to break through Torbin's impenetrable [[Force barrier|barrier]], she returned to the apothecary and Qimir gave her a vial of [[bunta]] [[poison]], so she could kill the Jedi.<ref name="Episode II" />

